     [0;90;1m│[0m [0;96mNote: A generator is test code, and an instance in the library is linked into everything that depends on the library, so the shipped executable carries QuickCheck and the generators with it. The -gen package exists so that dependency stops at the test suite, which is also what keeps a generator free to be as slow or as elaborate as the property needs.[0m
